47
00:07:28,283 --> 00:07:30,363
locations on a large scale map.

48
00:07:30,363 --> 00:07:35,383
The objective is simple, be the last player or squad standing by any means necessary.

49
00:07:35,383 --> 00:07:38,543
How you survive and how you choose to play the game is up to you.

50
00:07:38,543 --> 00:07:41,903
All players begin the game with nothing to defend themselves and you must search buildings

51
00:07:41,903 --> 00:07:45,163
and nearby areas for weapons, armor, and healing items.

52
00:07:45,163 --> 00:07:50,163
This is referred to as looting and is typically the very first thing you do after landing.

53
00:07:50,163 --> 00:07:53,323
At the start of the match, loot is randomly distributed around the map.

54
00:07:53,323 --> 00:07:56,903
While some areas are more likely to have better loot, you never know what you'll find in any

55
00:07:56,903 --> 00:07:57,903
given location.

56
00:07:57,903 --> 00:08:01,883
It's your choice to parachute into a crowded and dangerous location with large quantities

57
00:08:01,883 --> 00:08:05,323
of loot or land somewhere quiet with lower quantities of loot.

58
00:08:05,323 --> 00:08:08,783
The loot that you obtain throughout the match might affect how you play the game.

59
00:08:08,783 --> 00:08:12,203
You only found a shotgun, then focus on short range encounters.

60
00:08:12,203 --> 00:08:18,603
With a rifle and an 8x scope, explore the mountains and pick off players from a distance.

61
00:08:18,603 --> 00:08:21,963
Early in the game and shortly after looting, a large circle will be placed randomly onto

62
00:08:21,963 --> 00:08:22,963
the map.

63
00:08:22,963 --> 00:08:25,703
This circle is the new play area for all players.

64
00:08:25,703 --> 00:08:28,543
Once inside the circle, the game will continue as normal.

65
00:08:28,543 --> 00:08:30,703
The area outside of the circle is called the blue zone.

66
00:08:30,703 --> 00:08:34,203
If you're caught inside the blue zone, your health will slowly drain until you have no

67
00:08:34,203 --> 00:08:35,203
more left.

68
00:08:35,203 --> 00:08:39,083
The play area will continue to reduce in size and phases, and this encourages you to keep

69
00:08:39,083 --> 00:08:42,603
moving, and it also makes it difficult to stay hidden for too long.

70
00:08:42,603 --> 00:08:46,364
Of course, there is a lot more to PUBG than simply staying within the play area.

71
00:08:46,364 --> 00:08:50,124
Utilizing the environment around you is essential, whether that be hiding inside of a building,

72
00:08:50,124 --> 00:08:53,983
using trees as cover, or finding a hilltop to snipe unsuspecting foes.

73
00:08:53,983 --> 00:08:55,203
It's all fair game.

74
00:08:55,203 --> 00:08:58,864
The sounds you make throughout the match will play a large role in your survival.

75
00:08:58,864 --> 00:09:02,563
Running through a field, firing your weapon, driving a truck down the road, or simply walking

76
00:09:02,563 --> 00:09:06,963
up a set of stairs, if another player is close by, your presence will be obvious.

77
00:09:06,963 --> 00:09:09,244
But making loud noises can't always be avoided.

78
00:09:09,244 --> 00:09:13,403
You have to walk upstairs, you have to defend yourself, and sometimes you need to get somewhere

79
00:09:13,403 --> 00:09:14,403
